      "review_summary": "This PR adds an undefined guard to the allowed-values safe stringifier and regression coverage for `summarizeAllowedValues([undefined])`.\n\nPR surface: Source +7, Tests +9. Total +16 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-reproducible: current main reaches `String(value)` when `JSON.stringify(undefined)` returns undefined, which produces the literal display value. I did not run repo tests because this review kept the checkout read-only.",
